ഒന്നാം ഘട്ടത്തിലെ പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Desdemona, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, കണക്കിന്റെ അവസ്ഥ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of a big big big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act II: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Hamlet and Hamlet and the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Juliet and Juliet and a big big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and a big hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Romeo and Romeo and the sum of a big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Othello and Othello and the sum of a big big big hero and a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and a big big hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Macbeth and Macbeth and the sum of the sum of a big big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Lady Macbeth and Lady Macbeth and the sum of a big big big hero and a big big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: You are as good as the sum of the product of Ophelia and Ophelia and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero.
[Exeunt]

Act III: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big big big hero and a hero and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Desdemona]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and yourself.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big hero and a hero and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the difference between a big big big hero and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act IV: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Desdemona]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
